{'copyright': 'Copyright (c) 2020 The New York Times Company. All Rights Reserved.', 'response': {'docs': [{'abstract': 'After years of focusing on the offensive and defensive lines, and spending the commensurate draft capital, the Giants used the 2016 draft to shore up their perimeter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/01/sports/football/ignoring-linemen-new-york-giants-focus-on-pass-defense.html', 'snippet': 'After years of focusing on the offensive and defensive lines, and spending the commensurate draft capital, the Giants used the 2016 draft to shore up their perimeter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — After years of building a roster around their interior, focusing on the offensive and defensive lines, and spending the commensurate draft capital, the Giants used the 2016 draft to shore up their perimeter. And, primarily, to try to fix their faulty pass defense, which was worse than any other N.F.L. team’s last season. So, for the first time, the Giants did not select an offensive or defensive lineman in the draft.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/sports/01GIANTS/01GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/01/sports/01GIANTS/01GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/sports/01GIANTS/01GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/sports/01GIANTS/01GIANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'ran