ws', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b433e3e-1aad-5ee0-95b0-cdad2ea43227', 'word_count': 381, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b433e3e-1aad-5ee0-95b0-cdad2ea43227'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: British troops arrive in Egypt in 1941.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/05/01/1941-british-troops-in-egypt/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: British troops arrive in Egypt in 1941.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Thousands of British imperial troops disembarked today [May 1] at the port which they left a short month ago to fight in the Battle of the Balkans. They arrived in a large convoy and were the first contingent of that large part of the British expeditionary force withdrawn successfully from the Greek mainland under the noses of the seemingly numberless Nazi warplanes. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/blogs/02iht-oldmay02-egypt/02iht-oldmay02-egypt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/02/blogs/02iht-oldmay02-egypt/02iht-oldmay02-egypt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 598}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/blogs/02iht-oldmay02-egypt/02iht-oldmay02-egypt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/blogs/02iht-oldmay02-egypt/02iht-oldmay02-egypt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/blogs/02iht-oldmay02-egypt/02iht-oldmay02-egypt-thumbSta