ain high, a daunting problem for the next president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/02/us/20-years-later-welfare-overhaul-resonates-for-families-and-candidates.html', 'snippet': 'A 1996 law creating work rules and time limits for aid recipients was initially hailed as a success, but poverty rates remain high, a daunting problem for the next president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a sense, this is a “Back to the Future” presidential campaign, with candidates revisiting a specific time in the past to explain — and often lament — where the country is today. That period is often the 1990s, during Bill Clinton’s White House watch. It was when stricter anti-crime measures and looser financial regulations came into being, policies now attacked almost daily by contenders offering voters their visions and revisions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/multimedia/retro-welfare-reform/retro-welfare-reform-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/01/multimedia/retro-welfare-reform/retro-welfare-reform-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/multimedia/retro-welfare-reform/retro-welfare-reform-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/multimedia/retro-welfare-reform/retro-welfare-reform-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/multimedia/retro-welfare-reform/retro-welfare-reform-t