nippet': 'This play by Leah Nanako Winkler has a crowded stage and a frenetic rhythm, but heralds the arrival of a new voice in theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To love and to honor, to cherish and to obey. These verbs do not rank high on Hiro’s skill set or in her vocabulary. A capable New York marketing executive with a hip wardrobe, a blinkered emotional life and various substance-abuse issues, Hiro has decided to return to the abusive home she fled and disrupt her little sister’s calamitous marriage. This is a move that even her easygoing therapist characterizes as “a big, huge, self-destructive mistake.” Guess she won’t be angling to catch the bouquet.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/arts/02KENTUC/02KENTUC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/02/arts/02KENTUC/02KENTUC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/arts/02KENTUC/02KENTUC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/arts/02KENTUC/02KENTUC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/arts/02KENTUC/02KENTUC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/02/arts/02KENTUC/02KENTUC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capt