ratic convention would be contested because was “virtually impossible” for Hillary Clinton to reach a majority of convention delegates with pledged delegates alone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/05/01/bernie-sanders-says-superdelegates-should-follow-voters-will-in-landslide-states/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Sanders said on Sunday that the Democratic convention would be contested because was “virtually impossible” for Hillary Clinton to reach a majority of convention delegates with pledged delegates alone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bernie Sanders said on Sunday that he and Hillary Clinton were heading to a “contested” convention this summer because she will need superdelegates to secure the nomination, a claim that clashes with the accepted definition of a contested convention. He also said that superdelegates who have supported her should switch to him instead.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernie Sanders Says Superdelegates Should Follow Voters’ Will in Landslide States', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democratic National Convention', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-01T22:50:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Yamiche Alcindor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Yamiche', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alcindor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported