 None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/fashion/weddings/01BARNETTjpg/01BARNETTjpg-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1211, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/fashion/weddings/01BARNETTjpg/01BARNETTjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/01/fashion/weddings/01BARNETTjpg/01BARNETTjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/01/fashion/weddings/01BARNETTjpg/01BARNETTjpg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Clare Barnett, Marcos Huerta', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clare Barnett, Marcos Huerta', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-02T15:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/873af26c-cdb9-5e61-8501-4af4552b5034', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/873af26c-cdb9-5e61-8501-4af4552b5034'}, {'abstract': 'The Munich-based company BLACKYOTO sends old garments to Kyoto to be transformed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/02/t-magazine/blackyoto-japanese-upcycling-vintage-clothing.html', 'snippet': 'The Munich-based company BLACKYOTO sends old garments to Kyoto to be transformed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeremy McAlpine is constantly looking for underwear — and the older it is, the better. The founder and C.E.O. of the two-year-old brand BLACKYOTO has dealers in Paris, London and all over the Alpine region of Europe who call when they’ve found something good. “Late 19th- and early 20th-century undergarments — bloomers, petticoats, nightdresses and slips — make up the core of our women’s collection,” he says. He visits flea markets around Europe and works with vintage dealers to collect these garments. But, before going to out to luxury clothing retailers around the world, each garment is dyed black.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brand to Know: The Line Revitalizing Vintage Pieces — by Dyeing Them Black', 'kicker': 'On the Verge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Transforming Vintage With Dye', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BLACKYOTO (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAlpine, Jeremy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dyes and Dyestuffs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-02T15:02:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alex Ronan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alex', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ronan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60e65600-44ea-51b3-87b2-fcfab3db657b', 'word_count': 794, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60e65600-44ea-51b3-87b2-fcfab3db657b'}, {'abstract': 'After Robert Huth of Leicester pulled Marouane Fellaini’s hair on Sunday, Louis van Gaal took the postmatch interview to a bizarre place.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/03/sports/soccer/louis-van-gaal-manchester-united-sex-masochism.html', 'snippet': 'After Robert Huth of