is country.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, May 4, 1941', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1941: Italy Annexes Area of Slovenia', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Slovenia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-03T15:36:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/612a12e1-b239-5ab3-9919-cb0d15967882', 'word_count': 84, 'uri': 'nyt://article/612a12e1-b239-5ab3-9919-cb0d15967882'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans hold their largest majority since the Great Depression, but the Trump phenomenon has created the possibility of a Democratic breakthrough.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/04/us/politics/as-trump-rises-house-republicans-lose-that-sense-of-security.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans hold their largest majority since the Great Depression, but the Trump phenomenon has created the possibility of a Democratic breakthrough.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Republicans seized control of the House of Representatives in 2010, both parties agreed on this much: Democrats wouldn’t get it back anytime soon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/world/04Letter-web/04Letter-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge