o collect and share data, hoping to diversify the rank-and-file in Silicon Valley’s tech companies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Ellen Pao spent the last few years spotlighting the technology industry’s lack of diversity, in court and beyond. Erica Baker caused a stir at Google when she started a spreadsheet last year for employees to share their salaries, highlighting the pay disparities between those of different genders doing the same job. Laura I. Gómez founded a start-up focused on improving diversity in the hiring process.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1537, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/business/04include/04include-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women in Tech Band Together to Track Diversity, After Hours', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women in Tech Join Forces to Campaign for Diversity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Project Include', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pao, Ellen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gomez, Laura I', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baker, Erica (1980- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Silicon Valley (Calif)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-03T16:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Isaac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isaac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7af7fab-80e9-5e45-b6ca-9b4f0bc0f6a6', 'word_count': 1024, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7af7fab-80e9-5e45-b6ca-9b4f0bc0f6a6'}, {'abstract': 'Attorney General Eric T. Schneiderman of New York said Mr. Rosen failed to pay taxes on $80 million in artwork that he had bought or commissioned since 2002.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/04/nyregion/developer-aby-rosen-to-pay-7-million-in-suit-over-unpaid-taxes-on-art.html', 'snippet': 'Attorney General Eric T. Schneiderman of New York said Mr. Rosen failed to pay taxes on $80 million in artwork that he had bought or commissioned since 2002.', 'le