iences in Indiana, which is holding its primary on Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/05/03/donald-trump-master-of-promotion-now-pays-twitter-to-do-it-for-him-too/', 'snippet': 'Donald J. Trump’s campaign is paying to target certain posts on Twitter to audiences in Indiana, which is holding its primary on Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald J. Trump is perhaps the most prolific user of Twitter in political history. But as he tries to put a stranglehold on the Republican nomination with a victory Tuesday in Indiana, he is putting up some of his own money to increase his reach on Twitter.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/03/us/03firstdraft-trump2/03firstdraft-trump2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/03/us/03firstdraft-trump2/03firstdraft-trump2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/03/us/03firstdraft-trump2/03firstdraft-trump2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/03/us/03firstdraft-trump2/03firstdraft-trump2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/03/us/03firstdraft-trump2/03firstdraft-trump2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/03/us/03firstdraft-trump2/03firstdraft-trump2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight':