33c31e7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Silver, a Democrat from the Lower East Side, was for decades one of Albany’s most powerful legislators before being convicted of multiple counts of corruption.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/04/nyregion/sheldon-silver-ex-new-york-assembly-speaker-gets-12-year-prison-sentence.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Silver, a Democrat from the Lower East Side, was for decades one of Albany’s most powerful legislators before being convicted of multiple counts of corruption.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sheldon Silver, who rose from the Lower East Side of Manhattan to become one of the state’s most powerful and feared politicians as speaker of the New York Assembly, was sentenced on Tuesday to 12 years in prison in a case that came to symbolize Albany’s culture of graft.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sheldon Silver, Ex-New York Assembly Speaker, Gets 12-Year Prison Sentence', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Silver Is Given a 12-Year Term for Corruption', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Sheldon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bharara, Preet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics and Official Misconduct', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-03T19:35:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser and Vivian Yee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83dc0016-237b-5cb4-98a5-ac235789a5c0', 'word_count': 1159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83dc0016-237b-5cb4-98a5-ac235789a5c0'}, {'abstract': 'Tired of waxing and shaving, fashionable men are returning to their natural state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/06/fashion/men-chest-hair.html', 'snippet': 'Tired of waxing and shaving, fashionable men are returning to their natural state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shortly after he finished college, Eric Shoemaker, a 34-year-old Los Angeles-based public relations executive, allowed his chest hair to grow out. “I don’t know if it was my age or becoming comfortable with myself,” he said, “but the thought of getting waxed — which makes your hair follicles bleed and you get ingrown hairs — you have to ask who you’re doing it for.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/fashion/05-Body-Hair-1/05-Body-Hair-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/06/fashion/05-Body-Hair-1/05-Body-Hair-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/fashion/05-Body-Hair-1/05-Body-Hair-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/fashion/05-Body-Hair-1/05-Body-Hair-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'supe