atory cutbacks began in June 2015. Californians are expected to use at least 20 percent less water; previously, the order was to conserve by 25 percent. (AP)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'National Briefing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'National Briefing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LePage, Paul R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maine', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Michigan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservation of Resources', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lucas, George', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-03T23:51:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bca3a947-461b-5d82-be0b-0f8782c9da15', 'word_count': 486, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bca3a947-461b-5d82-be0b-0f8782c9da15'}, {'abstract': 'Some called for a more lasting solution amid charges that changes by the Obama administration had hindered government inspectors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/04/us/justice-dept-restoring-inspectors-access-to-records.html', 'snippet': 'Some called for a more lasting solution amid charges that changes by the Obama administration had hindered government inspectors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHING