strated the passion underscoring other protest movements since the 1960s, died on Friday at his home in Watsonville, Calif. He was 76.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bob Fitch, Photojournalist of Civil Rights Era, Dies at 76', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bob Fitch, 76, Activist Photographer  Who Captured Civil Rights Era, Dies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fitch, Bob (1939-2016)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights Movement (1954-68)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Martin Luther Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-04T01:11:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f4cd917-b32a-5b8f-93f6-8460acdd9dfd', 'word_count': 1055, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f4cd917-b32a-5b8f-93f6-8460acdd9dfd'}, {'abstract': 'This is when early general-election polls start to become meaningful, and Donald J. Trump trails Hillary Clinton by around 10 percentage points.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/04/upshot/trump-would-have-uphill-battle-against-clinton.html', 'snippet': 'This is when early general-election polls start to become meaningful, and Donald J. Trump trails Hillary Clinton by around 10 percentage points.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A general election matchup between Donald J. Trump and Hillary Clinton became all but certain on Tuesday after Mr. Trump’s deci