ls-while-commuting.html', 'snippet': 'The court sentences a husband to soft labor as a postwork entertainer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Craig asks: My wife calls me every day on her commute home with the expectation that I will chat with her for the duration of her drive. I am effectively her personal podcast. She says she wants to hear my voice. This is false. She is bored and wants to be entertained. Please make it stop.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1023, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1252, 'width': 1253, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08hodgman/08mag-08hodgman-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge John Hodgman on Phone Calls While Commuting', 'kicker': 'Judge John Hodgman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bonus Advice From Judge John Hodgman', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hodgman, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Commuting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-04T11:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Hodgman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hodgman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fdb313b-489c-5f8d-b129-aeb04f284f24', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fdb313b-489c-5f8d-b129-aeb04f284f24'}, {'abstract': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on what you’re obliged to reveal when applying for long-term-care insurance and whether to call out a relative’s bigoted Facebook posts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/08/magazine/must-suspicions-about-personal-health-be-shared-with-an-insurer.html', 'snippet': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on what you’re obliged to reveal when applying for long-term-care insurance and whether to call out a relative’s bigoted Facebook posts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have Parkinson’s disease — at least, I think I do. I have a slight tremor in my right hand, my posture is becoming more stooped and I have a diminished sense of smell. I have not spoken about this with a physician. I have discussed it with a couple of other people who have the disease.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08ethicist/08mag-08ethicist-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 596, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08ethicist/08mag-08ethicist-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 596, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08ethicist/08ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08ethicist/08ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/magazine/08ethicist/08ethicist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Must Suspicions About Personal Health Be Shared With an Insurer?', 'kicker': 'The Ethicist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Must I Share My Medical Fears With an Insurer?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethicists, The (Times Column)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Appiah, Kwame Anthony', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Long-Term Care Insurance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank