 {'abstract': 'An improbable tale of how a British maverick harnessed crowdsourced meteorological discoveries to reveal the poetic wonders of the sky.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/08/magazine/the-amateur-cloud-society-that-sort-of-rattled-the-scientific-community.html', 'snippet': 'An improbable tale of how a British maverick harnessed crowdsourced meteorological discoveries to reveal the poetic wonders of the sky.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gavin Pretor-Pinney decided to take a sabbatical. It was the summer of 2003, and for the last 10 years, as a sideline to his graphic-design business in London, he and a friend had been running a magazine called The Idler. The Idler was devoted to the “literature for loafers.” It argued against busyness and careerism and for the ineffable value of aimlessness, of letting the imagination quietly coast. Pretor-Pinney anticipated all the jokes: that he’d burned out running a magazine devoted to doing nothing, and so on. But it was true. Getting the magazine out was taxing, and after a decade, it seemed appropriate to stop for a while and live without a plan — to be an idler himself and shake free space for fresh ideas. So he swapped his flat in London for one in Rome, where everything would be new and anything could happen.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1479, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/02/magazine/08cloudspotters1/08cloudspotters1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Amateur Cloud Society That (Sort Of) Rattled the Scientific Community', 'kicker': 'Feature', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Head in the Clouds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pretor-Pinney, Gavin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Meteorological Organization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howard, Luke', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abercromby, Ralph', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crowdsourcing (Internet)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-04T11:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Mooallem', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mooallem', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organiz