 I don’t know! I gotta get the best one.” Then he interrupts the character he’s been playing: “Why? Who are you, the King of Siam, that you should get the best one ever?”', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 963, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 963}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 638, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1276, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/t-magazine/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0/22tmag-05look_sign-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'ma