'word_count': 1224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96534b6b-4721-5369-ba29-817c9eba9beb'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Hilty featured songs by Irving Berlin as part of her tribute to Rosemary Clooney at Café Carlyle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/05/arts/music/review-megan-hilty-goes-beyond-daffy-to-sweetness-even-regret.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Hilty featured songs by Irving Berlin as part of her tribute to Rosemary Clooney at Café Carlyle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The songwriter Irving Berlin came up with the simplest remedy for insomnia more than six decades ago: “When I’m worried and I can’t sleep, I count my blessings instead of sheep.” That song, “Count Your Blessings,” was crooned by Bing Crosby in the movie “White Christmas” to Rosemary Clooney, who heeded his words, then sang them back to him. Ah, the good old days before Ambien, Xanax and a hundred other chemical panaceas for 3 a.m. sleeplessness.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05HILTY/05HILTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05HILTY/05HILTY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05HILTY/05HILTY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05HILTY/05HILTY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05HILTY/05HILTY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wi