Carolina has backing from two big companies, Bayer and Syngenta, as well as venture capital firms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/05/business/agriculture-start-ups-get-boost-from-big-firms-and-investors.html', 'snippet': 'The AgTech Accelerator being started in North Carolina has backing from two big companies, Bayer and Syngenta, as well as venture capital firms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Compared with medicine, where small companies often lead in turning cutting-edge science into new drugs, agriculture has never had much start-up activity. Agricultural biotechnology, for instance, has been dominated by six giant seed and chemical companies, including Monsanto and DuPont.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Agriculture Start-Ups Get Boost From Big Firms and Investors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Boost for Start-Ups in Agricultural Tech', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AgTech Accelerator', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Research Triangle Park (NC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-04T21:50:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0de9db8a-7176-5f37-81c0-ca5b58bf3fbe', 'word_count': 620, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0de9db8a-7176-5f37-81c0-ca5b58bf3fbe'}, {'abstract': 'For the second year in a row, this principal dancer has removed herself from performances for medical reasons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/05/arts/dance/polina-semionova-withdraws-from-american-ballet-theaters-2016-spring-season.html', 'snippet': 'For the second year in a row, this principal dancer has removed herself from performances for medical reasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the second year in a row, Polina Semionova, a principal dancer at American Ballet Theater, is withdrawing from its spring season at the Metropolitan Opera House, the company announced this week. It said she would be taking a medical leave, but did not elaborate.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05Polinaitem/05Polinaitem-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05Polinaitem/05Polinaitem-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05Polinaitem/05Polinaitem-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05Polinaitem/05Polinaitem-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1315, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05Polinaitem/05Polinaitem-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/05/arts/05Polinaitem/05Polinaitem-thumbStandar