isticated attack from multiple directions, they used armored bulldozers to plow over a protective trench so their convoy of trucks — some laden with explosives — could drive deep into the town. Residents and some local soldiers quickly fled.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 819, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1638, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/world/05iraq-web/05iraq-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Another Combat Death in Iraq May Presage Future U.S. Role', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Firefight Death in Iraq May Presage U.S. Future', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keating, Charles H IV (1985-2016)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mazzetti, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Navy Seals', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-05T01:05:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Mazzetti and Helene Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mazzetti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Helene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4087437-68da-5146-98d4-c153da008977', 'word_count': 1079, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4087437-68da-5146-98d4-c153da008977'}, {'abstract': 'Real Madrid’s 1-0 victory means it will face Atlético Madrid, its city and Spanish league rival, in the final for the second time in three years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/05/sports/soccer/real-madrid-beats-manchester-city-to-reach-champions-league-final.html', 'snippet': 'Real Madrid’s 1-0 victory means it will face Atlético Madrid, its city and Spanish league rival, in the final for the second time in three years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — Real Madrid’s 1-0 victory over Manchester City on Wednesday was not about inspiring and pulsating soccer. Madrid scored its only goal on a deflection off a defender’s leg. C