oo much for the president.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Erdogan Moved to Solidify Power by Ousting a Pivotal Ally', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How Erdogan Ousted Turkish Premier in Drive for Power', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yeginsu, Ceylan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davutoglu, Ahmet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arango, Tim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erdogan, Recep Tayyip', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice and Development Party (Turkey)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and Africa Migrant Crisis', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Democracy (Theory and Philosophy)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-05T11:51:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Arango and Ceylan Yeginsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Arango', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Ceylan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yeginsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a3f6412d-aae4-5d43-bd7c-8abdabb9da32', 'word_count': 1250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a3f6412d-aae4-5d43-bd7c-8abdabb9da32'}, {'abstract': 'The e-commerce giant said a revenue surge showed the power of the Chin