ndurance for both car and owner considering the model’s small, Spartan demeanor back then.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Review: Kia Sportage Gets a Stylish Makeover', 'kicker': 'Driven', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kia Sportage Gets a Stylish Makeover', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kia Motors Corp', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-05T13:12:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'New Cars', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Voelk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Voelk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff6dd587-377e-5013-a55b-66eddfbb8415', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff6dd587-377e-5013-a55b-66eddfbb8415'}, {'abstract': 'Kendra and Allan Daniel are making room in their townhouse for works they lent to the American Folk Art Museum for an exhibition that is closing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/06/nyregion/new-jersey-collectors-at-home-with-their-art.html', 'snippet': 'Kendra and Allan Daniel are making room in their townhouse for works they lent to the American Folk Art Museum for an exhibition that is closing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARK RIDGE, N.J. — The walls in Kendra and Allan Daniel’s townhouse are crowded — very crowded. There are folk-art paintings. There is an original drawing from “Winnie-the-Pooh.” There is a watercolor by Humphrey Bogart’s mother.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/nyregion