easing control over a party and responding to remarks on a pricey gift.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/08/fashion/heart-attack-wedding-invitation-parties-gifts.html', 'snippet': 'Also, getting out of an ugly corner, easing control over a party and responding to remarks on a pricey gift.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a false heart attack scare, I was given a diagnosis of  coronary artery disease with 80 percent arterial blockage. I am 53, in good shape, a nonsmoker, and gave up eating lard in my youth. (That is a joke. I never ate lard.) But I am genetically predisposed to high cholesterol. When sharing my news with family and friends, I have been taken aback by their mostly blaming and impolite questions: Do I drink too much or have too much stress, instead of offering kind words. How should I respond?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 599}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 