.html', 'snippet': 'For a number of men in New York, this is the life that makes emotional and economic sense.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a warm spring evening, James Lee sat drinking a gin and tonic on the balcony of the apartment he shares with two roommates in Crown Heights, Brooklyn. He had the night off from his job as a server at a Manhattan restaurant, and he was talking about the high cost of living in New York and what it’s like to have roommates at his age (33).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/fashion/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO/05MALEANIMAL-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/05/fashion/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO/05MALEANIMAL-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 651}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/fashion/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO/05MALEANIMAL-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 945, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/fashion/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO/05MALEANIMAL-COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1889, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/fashion/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/05/fashion/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO/05MS-ROOMATES-COMBO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '