nd members, mostly based in the United States, perform as alter egos — aliens from the planet Peelander. Kengo calls himself Peelander-Yellow; his bassist and longtime friend Kotaro Tsukada, is Peelander-Red. Peelander-Green is seen on drums.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Mad Tiger,’ or the Story of Peelander-Z’s Near Breakup', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Review: ‘Mad Tiger,’ or the Story of Peelander-Z’s Near Breakup', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yi, Jonathan (1982- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haertlein, Michael (Filmmaker)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Peelander-Z (Music Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Mad Tiger (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-05T20:41:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Kenigsberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kenigsberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/16f4224f-fcc1-51ac-957c-6e9a4dbbb9b1', 'word_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16f4224f-fcc1-51ac-957c-6e9a4dbbb9b1'}, {'abstract': 'Kyle Andrew Bessemer, 29, of Ann Arbor was arraigned on four felony counts after a combination of mouse poison and hand sanitizer was sprayed on produce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/06/us/michigan-man-charged-with-sprinkling-poison-on-food-at-stores.html', 'snippet': 'Kyle Andrew Bessemer, 29, of Ann Arbor was arraigned on four felony counts af