 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/06/arts/dance/new-york-city-ballet-opens-a-spring-gala-and-some-umbrellas.html', 'snippet': 'The troupe featured world premieres from Nicolas Blanc and Christopher Wheeldon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City Ballet, founded in 1948, has always had a nonpareil record for its abundance of important new choreography. From the last century, I remember City Ballet galas that presented world premieres by George Balanchine and Jerome Robbins. On Wednesday, the company’s 2016 Spring Gala was principally about 21st-century choreography.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NYCBGALA/06NYCBGALA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NYCBGALA/06NYCBGALA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NYCBGALA/06NYCBGALA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NYCBGALA/06NYCBGALA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1336, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NYCBGALA/06NYCBGALA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NYCBGALA/06NYCBGALA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images