recognition of the exhibition’s temporary occupation of Basketball City, NADA Hoops is organizing a three-on-three pickup basketball tournament on outdoor courts. The artist Tyson Reeder has designed balls for the occasion. His limited edition “4-Color Pen Ball” (2016) has each of its panels filled in with scribbles in one of four standard, ballpoint pen colors: red, green, black and blue. Examples are on display in the fair and will be used on the courts. As for art, it’s a fun show. Here are a few highlights, listed by gallery:', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1325, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/arts/06NADA1/06NADA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 