Manager Joe Girardi was ejected early, which meant he did not have a front-row seat to the Yankees’ latest teeth-gnashing defeat, a 1-0, 10-inning loss to the Baltimore Orioles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/06/sports/baseball/baltimore-orioles-defeat-ny-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'Manager Joe Girardi was ejected early, which meant he did not have a front-row seat to the Yankees’ latest teeth-gnashing defeat, a 1-0, 10-inning loss to the Baltimore Orioles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BALTIMORE — Perhaps Manager Joe Girardi could have saved himself some teeth-gnashing Thursday night when he was kicked out of the game in the fourth inning if he had showered and headed somewhere bucolic with a glass of red wine in his hand.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/sports/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/06/sports/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/sports/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/sports/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/sports/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES/SUB-06-CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_na