son': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/e39515c3-0a40-5875-b860-7024067d21fb', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/e39515c3-0a40-5875-b860-7024067d21fb'}, {'abstract': 'What was wrong with a man who suddenly became ill at his brother’s wedding? More than 400 of you offered your diagnoses, but no one got it completely right.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/05/06/think-like-a-doctor-sick-at-the-wedding-solved/', 'snippet': 'What was wrong with a man who suddenly became ill at his brother’s wedding? More than 400 of you offered your diagnoses, but no one got it completely right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday, we asked Well readers to take on a challenging case. A 38-year-old man who traveled to the mountains of Colorado for his brother’s wedding suddenly became ill. He had fevers and chills, chest pain, a severe headache and a sore throat. There was so much going on that it was really tough to see what might be underlying it all. More than 400 of you offered your diagnoses, but no one got it completely right. I had to choose two winners, each of whom was the first to get at least part of it right. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 535, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 535}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 914, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1581, 'width': 1772, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/06/health/tladsolved/tladsolved-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Think Like a Doctor: Sick at the Wedding Solved!', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIBIOTICS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emergency Medical Treatment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Strep Throat', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-06T19:33:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Sanders, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanders', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4bc5aee-fb12-554b-a4b0-171fabee97c4', 'word_count': 1385, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4bc5aee-fb12-554b-a4b0-171fabee97c4'}, {'abstract': 'A new trip to Spain from the travel company Zicasso traces his footsteps from Madrid to La Mancha.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/08/travel/celebrating-cervantes-in-spain-lodging-and-art-in-marfa.html', 'snippet': 'A new trip to Spain from the travel company Zicasso traces his footsteps from Madrid to La Mancha.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year marks the 400th anniversary of the death of Miguel de Cervantes, the renowned Spanish writer and author of the enduringly popular “Don Quixote” In commemoration, a new trip to Spain from the travel company Zicasso traces his footsteps from Madrid to La Mancha. The eight-day Miguel de Cervantes 400-Year Tribute Tour begins in Madrid; a Cervantes expert provides background on the author and his works and takes travelers to the convent where he is buried. Visitors also travel to the writer’s hometown, the Unesco World Heritage City of Alcalá de Henares; visit Esquivias, the village where he married and wrote much of the second half of “Don Quixote”; see a live performance of the book at a 17th-century open-air theater in the town of Almagro; and take a cooking class in dishes popular when he was alive such as pipirrana, a Spanish potato salad.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1425, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/travel/08BRIEF1/08BRIEF1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Celebrating Cervantes in Spain; Lodging (and Art) in Marfa', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Marfa (Tex)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Almagro (Spain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-06T19:37:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08e350f5-fb61-57f7-8370-bde4c55d5c23', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08e350f5-fb61-57f7-8370-bde4c55d5c23'}, {'abstract': 'Eulalio Tordi, 62, was in custody after his wife and two other people were killed in separate attacks over two days in Maryland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/07/us/federal-law-officer-suspected-in-3-fatal-shootings-in-washington-suburbs.html', 'snippet': 'Eulalio Tordi, 62, was in custody after his wife and two other people were killed in separate attacks over two days in Maryland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The police suspect that the same man, a federal law enforcement officer, committed three shootings on Thursday and Friday, kil