nd litigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — As a former aide to both Andrew M. Cuomo and his father, Todd R. Howe built a reputation as a prominent lobbyist in Albany and Washington, with top clients like the Metropolitan Museum of Art and major developers in upstate New York.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/07/nyregion/07HOWE1/07HOWE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Loyalist With Troubled Finances Is at Center of U.S. Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Longtime Cuomo Loyalist  Is at Center of U.S. Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McKinley, Jesse', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Mario M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howe, Todd R (1960- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-07T01:17:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivian Yee and Jesse McKinley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3497dc96-bca5-50d7-ab6a-0d7c4c20cd37', 'word_count': 1340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3497dc96-bca5-50d7-ab6a-0d7c4c20cd37'}, {'abstract': 'Clinton vs. Trump could be the ugliest presidential contest of modern times. But in that mess there may still be an opportunity for constructive dialogue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/07/opinion/how-do-you-debate-mr-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Clinton vs. Trump could be the ugliest presidential contest of modern times. But in that mess there may still be an opportunity for constructive dialogue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Months away from their expected nominations, there’s already ample reason to expect Clinton vs. Trump to be the ugliest, most cringeworthy presidential contest of the modern era. It promises to be a half-year slog through the m