ee laureates, who were in the North for what was billed as an educational exchange, said tight Internet controls hindered students’ progress.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/08/world/asia/after-north-korea-trip-nobel-laureates-describe-students-eager-to-learn.html', 'snippet': 'The three laureates, who were in the North for what was billed as an educational exchange, said tight Internet controls hindered students’ progress.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Three Nobel laureates in science and economics who visited North Korea this week for what was billed as an educational exchange said Saturday that they had met university students who were eager to learn, but who were hampered by the North’s tight Internet controls and by rudimentary, decades-old equipment.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/world/asia/08northkoreanobel-web1/08northkoreanobel-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/08/world/asia/08northkoreanobel-web1/08northkoreanobel-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/world/asia/08northkoreanobel-web1/08northkoreanobel-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/world/asia/08northkoreanobel-web1/08northkoreanobel-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/world/asia/08northkoreanobel-web1/08northkor