my Tan, who runs two Chinese restaurants under the Orient name, reopened the newer one recently after shutting it down for six weeks to correct some early stumbles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/08/nyregion/review-fresh-start-at-orient-odyssey-in-jericho.html', 'snippet': 'Tommy Tan, who runs two Chinese restaurants under the Orient name, reopened the newer one recently after shutting it down for six weeks to correct some early stumbles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the past 15 years the Orient in Bethpage has been the gold standard for Chinese restaurants on Long Island. In March 2015, Tommy Tan, the owner, opened a new restaurant, Orient Odyssey, in Jericho. But based on some lunches I had at the Odyssey in its early days, the new restaurant didn’t seem to be quite in the same league as its sibling.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/nyregion/08DINELI1/08DINELI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/08/nyregion/08DINELI1/08DINELI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/nyregion/08DINELI1/08DINELI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 561, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/nyregion/08DINELI1/08DINELI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1122, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/nyregion/08DINELI1/08DINELI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':