entions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/09/arts/music/review-librettos-and-ariosos-meet-video-at-anthology-film-archives.html', 'snippet': 'The production company Experiments in Opera commissioned five videos (each 20 minutes or less) that honor operatic conventions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Opera on video has been around for practically as long as video. But video opera — that is, operatic works conceived for video — has a spottier history, which is curious. As part of its mission, the Experiments in Opera initiative commissioned five video operas from five composers and their teams. Anthology Film Archives presented the premieres of these fascinating works (of 20 minutes or less) on Friday night.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/09/arts/09VIDEOOPERAS/09VIDEOOPERAS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/09/arts/09VIDEOOPERAS/09VIDEOOPERAS2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/09/arts/09VIDEOOPERAS/09VIDEOOPERAS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/09/arts/09VIDEOOPERAS/09VIDEOOPERAS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1148, 'width': 2042, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/09/arts/09VIDEOOPERAS/09VIDEOOPERAS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/09/arts/09VIDEOOPERAS/09