hina-blue-miao-dye.html', 'snippet': 'Disillusioned with China’s urban dream, a young man set off on a 15-year walk and rediscovered his family’s ethnic Miao traditions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINGYUE, China — I once saw a photo of a man with blue hands. They belonged to an artisan textile dyer, an ethnic Miao who goes by the name Han Shan, or Cold Mountain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Sichuan Province, an Artisan Retreats to China’s Past', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dyes and Dyestuffs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Textiles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sichuan Province (China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-08T21:30:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonah M. Kessel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d84ac31-dc4a-5b86-ba38-2e8ec6ba1b5e', 'word_count': 626, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d84ac31-dc4a-5b86-ba38-2e8ec6ba1b5e'}, {'abstract': 'In its ninth studio album, Radiohead worries about environmental devastation, mass thoughtlessness and love gone cold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/09/arts/music/radiohead-a-moon-shaped-pool-review.html', 'snippet': 'In its ninth studio album, Radiohead worries about environmental devastation, mass thoughtlessness and love gone cold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The future is dire, the past a blur and the present heartbroken yet hinting at possibilities on Radiohead’s “A Moon Shaped Pool,” its ninth s