ract': 'Mr. Cruz is expected to return to Washington this week, but it is unclear whether he will fall in line with Donald J. Trump’s candidacy and with his fellow lawmakers on Capitol Hill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/09/us/politics/ted-cruz-at-a-crossroads-as-he-returns-to-the-senate.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cruz is expected to return to Washington this week, but it is unclear whether he will fall in line with Donald J. Trump’s candidacy and with his fellow lawmakers on Capitol Hill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Senator Ted Cruz of Texas is expected to return to the Capitol this week, the last of four Republican senators battered and beaten by Donald J. Trump to trudge back to the world of meetings over cafeteria cod and roll call votes to name the national mammal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/us/09cruz/09cruz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/08/us/09cruz/09cruz-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/us/09cruz/09cruz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/us/09cruz/09cruz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/08/us/09cruz/09cruz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/08/us/09cruz/09cruz-thumbSta