ornia law, it is a crime in to carry a loaded firearm on one’s person in public, and the court ruled unanimously that there was no distinction between clothing that is being worn and a backpack, fanny pack or other container strapped to the body. (AP)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'National Briefing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'National Briefing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maryland', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-09T23:58:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62ea9a16-aa91-5414-8982-63fdefa858ae', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62ea9a16-aa91-5414-8982-63fdefa858ae'}, {'abstract': 'A granite block with Donald J. Trump’s name, birth year and a blunt epitaph appeared in March, and the police had to make sure it was not a threat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/10/nyregion/trump-headstone-in-central-park-mystery-solved.html', 'snippet': 'A granite block with Donald J. Trump’s name, birth year and a blunt epitaph appeared in March, and the police had to make sure it was not a threat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It arrived in Central Park before dawn that Sunday, an instant attraction before it was quickly hauled away by a team of parks department workers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': Non