-meditation-at-home/', 'snippet': 'There are many apps, classes and books to guide children in meditation, but it is easy (and free) to start at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are many apps, classes and books to guide children in meditation, but it is easy (and free) to start at home. You don’t need props like chimes or incense. The more meditation becomes integrated into daily living, the more successful it will be. Here are some exercises to try.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Three Ways for Children to Try Meditation at Home', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meditation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-10T10:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jillian Pransky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jillian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pransky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c295b8c7-2d44-54a8-9f10-b866014ecd4e', 'word_count': 458, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c295b8c7-2d44-54a8-9f10-b866014ecd4e'}, {'abstract': 'As a large Methodist conference is set to convene on Tuesday with plans to consider the boycott, divestment, and sanctions campaign, Mrs. Clinton has written a letter denouncing the movement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2016/05/10/hillary-clinton-criticizes-group-advocating-boycott-against-israel/', 'snippet': 'As a large Methodist conference is set to convene on Tuesday with plans to consider the boycott, divestment, and sanctions campaign, Mrs. Clinton has written a letter denouncing the movement.', 'lead_pa