A study\xa0published recently in the journal\xa0Mindfulness found similar improvements in mathematics in fifth graders with attention deficit hyperactivity disorder. And a\xa0study\xa0of elementary school children in Korea showed that eight weeks of meditation lowered aggression, social anxiety and stress levels.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2040, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/05/health/well_meditation-slide-TLA3/well_meditation-slide-TLA3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 15