 Trump on too thick too soon, since there will be plenty of time to go around and around on the question\xa0between here\xa0and November. But one issue\xa0seems worth highlighting now, because it’s come up repeatedly in conversations with what you might call the Trump-curious among my friends and family and peers. Basically, when you make\xa0an argument like the one I made in my Sunday column, to the effect that a President Trump’s likely governing style would raise the risks of\xa0national and global instability to an extent that trumps (if you will) many normal ideological\xa0concerns, they tend to raise an eyebrow and say, compared to what?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Pessimist’s Case Against Trump', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Torture', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, George W', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Middle East', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-10T16:17:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/590ac028-b09f-56c5-907d-0f6817a45101', 'word_count': 1305, 'uri': 'nyt://article/590ac028-b09f-56c5-907d-0f6817a45101'}, {'abstract': 'Ahmad Manasra was found guilty in a stabbing attack that critically injured an Israeli teenager, Naor Ben-Ezra, 13, and wounded an Israeli man, part of a wave of violence that began last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/11/world/middleeast/palestinian-teenager-is-convicted-of-attempted-murder-in-stabbing-attack.html', 'snippet': 'Ahmad Manasra was found guilty in a stabbing attack that critically injured an Israeli teenager, Naor Ben-Ezra, 13, and wounded an Israeli man, part of a wave of violence that began last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — An Israeli court on Tuesday convicted a Palestinian teenager of two counts of attempted murder for his role in a stabbing attack that critically injured an Israeli teenager and wounded an Israeli man in a Jewish area of East Jerusalem in October.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/world/11israel-web/11israel-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 838, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/11/world/11israel-web/11israel-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 838}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/world/11israel-web/11israel-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 734, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05