7-b848-96ad66fb41b8'}, {'abstract': 'A Mexican washing-machine magnate, Mr. Carlín was a a 50-year-old skipper of scant experience when he entered — and unaccountably won — the first Whitbread race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/11/sports/sailing/ramon-carlin-casual-sailor-who-won-a-round-the-world-race-dies-at-92.html', 'snippet': 'A Mexican washing-machine magnate, Mr. Carlín was a a 50-year-old skipper of scant experience when he entered — and unaccountably won — the first Whitbread race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ramón Carlín, a Mexican washing-machine magnate who was a 50-year-old sailboat skipper of scant experience when he entered — and unaccountably won — the first Whitbread Round the World Race, a Mother Nature- and death-defying competition of more than seven months and 27,000 nautical miles across storm-tossed and near-frozen seas, died on Thursday in Mexico City. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11carlin-obit/11carlin-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11carlin-obit/11carlin-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11carlin-obit/11carlin-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11carlin-obit/11carlin-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1003, 'width': 1487, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/spo