bliterating the record for 3-pointers or becoming the N.B.A.’s first unanimous most valuable player, Curry continues to astound.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/11/sports/basketball/stephen-curry-turns-the-amazing-into-the-everyday-and-raises-the-bar-over-and-over.html', 'snippet': 'Whether it’s leading his team to an unprecedented number of wins, obliterating the record for 3-pointers or becoming the N.B.A.’s first unanimous most valuable player, Curry continues to astound.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PORTLAND, Ore. — On Monday morning, when it was still unclear whether Stephen Curry would even play for the Golden State Warriors that night, news began to circulate at the team’s shootaround that Curry would be named the N.B.A.’s most valuable player for a second straight season. An official announcement from the league was coming.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11CURRY1/11CURRY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11CURRY1/11CURRY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11CURRY1/11CURRY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11CURRY1/11CURRY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1305, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/sports/11CURRY1/11CURRY1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop