erial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/669524e9-2db4-5f8f-b857-5841c0895fb1', 'word_count': 1316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/669524e9-2db4-5f8f-b857-5841c0895fb1'}, {'abstract': 'New legislation on claims for property lost during and after World War II was seen as a small acknowledgment of the treatment of Jews.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/11/world/europe/romania-holocaust-survivors-jews-restitution-claims.html', 'snippet': 'New legislation on claims for property lost during and after World War II was seen as a small acknowledgment of the treatment of Jews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BUCHAREST, Romania — The Romanian government on Tuesday approved legislation that would give priority to restitution claims by Holocaust survivors for property lost during World War II and under Communist rule. The move was seen as a small acknowledgment of the treatment of Romanian Jews during the war.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romania Takes Step Toward Restitution to Holocaust Survivors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Romania Takes Step for Holocaust Survivor Restitution', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Romania', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holocaust and the Nazi Era', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reparations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Jewish Restitution Organization', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Romanian Communist Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-11T00:58:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kit Gillet', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gillet', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53c12769-2ed4-5d57-9411-e66f177be06c', 'word_count': 394, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53c12769-2ed4-5d57-9411-e66f177be06c'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Harper, who taught at Brown University for over 40 years, embraced an idiom interwoven with music, history and his experiences as a black man.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/11/arts/michael-s-harper-poet-with-a-jazz-pulse-dies-at-78.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Harper, who taught at Brown University for over 40 years, embraced an idiom interwoven with music, history and his experiences as a black man.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael S. Harper, whose allusive, jazz-inflected poems interwove his personal experiences as a black man with an expansive view of a history shared by black and white Americans, and who was a finalist for the National Book Award in poetry in 1978, died on Saturday in Rhinebeck, N.Y. He was 78.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12harper-obit-1/12harper-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12harper-obit-1/12harper-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12harper-obit-1/12harper-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12harper-obit-1/12harper-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'heig