Parliament, Westminster Hall, which has played a major role in England’s history for nearly a thousand years, Westminster Abbey and the British Museum, unrivaled in the world for the richness and variety of its contents, were among the famous London landmarks damaged by last night’s heavy Nazi raid on Great Britain’s capital. The Luftwaffe paid its heaviest penalty of the war for its night attacks on Britain, however, for thirty-three Nazi bombers were destroyed last night, the Air Ministry announced. Twenty-nine of these were shot down by British night fighters.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, May 12, 1941', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/blogs/12iht-oldmay12-london/12iht-oldmay12-london-articleLarge.png', 'height': 519, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/12/blogs/12iht-oldmay12-london/12iht-oldmay12-london-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 519}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/blogs/12iht-oldmay12-london/12iht-oldmay12-london-jumbo.png', 'height': 820, 'width': 948, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/blogs/12iht-oldmay12-london/12iht-oldmay12-london-superJumbo.png', 'height': 820, 'width': 948, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/blogs/12iht-oldmay12-london/12iht-oldmay12-london-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/12/blogs/12iht-oldmay12-london/12iht-oldmay12-london-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75,