 detainees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/12/nyregion/health-care-at-new-jersey-immigrant-jail-prompts-claim.html', 'snippet': 'The Hudson County Correctional Facility is the focus of a civil rights complaint brought by advocates, who cite dozens of cases of what they call subpar or even dangerous medical care for detainees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nelson Fernandez and his daughter Jennifer were still asleep when agents from United States Immigration and Customs Enforcement knocked at their door early one morning two years ago. The next minutes were a terrifying blur to Ms. Fernandez, a United States citizen, who recalls armed agents swarming through their small Manhattan apartment and taking away her father, who is disabled by a rare autoimmune disorder and dependent on blood thinners to prevent fatal clots.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/nyregion/12DETAIN1/12DETAIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/12/nyregion/12DETAIN1/12DETAIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/nyregion/12DETAIN1/12DETAIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/nyregion/12DETAIN1/12DETAIN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/nyregion/12DETAIN1/12DETAIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr