ny parts of the country is making house hunting a challenge this spring, especially for first-time buyers.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tips for House Hunting in a Seller’s Market', 'kicker': 'Your Money Adviser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tips for House Hunting in a Seller’s Market', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carrns, Ann', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-11T21:15:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80943ec0-b4a3-51b1-9240-fa849024329f', 'word_count': 974, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80943ec0-b4a3-51b1-9240-fa849024329f'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Winfrey said she has been thinking about performing in a play for the last three years, but first she has to find the “perfect material.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/12/theater/oprah-winfrey-dreams-of-a-broadway-debut-just-dont-expect-her-to-sing.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Winfrey said she has been thinking about performing in a play for the last three years, but first she has to find the “perfect material.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'For 34 years, Oprah Winfrey has been revisiting “The Color Purple,” as a reader, as a performer and as a producer. And yet, there she was on Tuesday night, in row F at the Bernard B. Jacobs Theater, mouthing the words to the songs, waving her hands in the air, leading a mid-act standing ovation and weeping once again.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1357, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12OPRAH/12OPRAH-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Oprah Winfrey Dreams of a Broadway Debut (Just Don’t Expect Her to Sing)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oprah Dreams of a Broadway Debut', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winfrey, Oprah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Color Purple (Play)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-11T21:24:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Paulson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Paulson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbaeb599-6a61-5be2-8f04-b61380b671f7', 'word_count': 985, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbaeb599-6a61-5be2-8f04-b61380b671f7'}, {'abstract': 'This company has been dancing “Ballo della Regina” and other works of its founder, George Balanchine, during its spring season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/12/arts/dance/for-city-ballet-a-balanchine-season-of-renewal.html', 'snippet': 'This company has been dancing “Ballo della Regina” and other works of its founder, George Balanchine, during its spring season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City Ballet has been renewing itself at all levels in its current six-week season, which is now in its fourth week. Dancers in the corps have shown exceptional talent in lead roles, notably that zephyr Joseph Gordon in “Symphony in Three Movements” (seen on May 5), the tall powerhouse Emily Kikta as the soloist in “Rubies,” the impishly ebullient Indiana Woodward in the pas de trois of “Emeralds” (both May 1). On Tuesday, its senior ballerina, Maria Kowroski, returned to the stage after childbirth, almost a year after her last performance. She’s the same tall and slender vision as ever, but with a newly free expansiveness.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/12/arts/12NYCBNOTEBOOK/12NYCBNOTEBOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 3