“It welcomes you,” he said in a recent interview at American Ballet Theater’s studios on lower Broadway. “You don’t feel like an outsider.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15RATMANSKY/15RATMANSKY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Alexei Ratmansky Has Russian Poetry and an American Pulse', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russian Poetry, American Pulse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BALLET THEATER', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ratmansky, Alexei', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Swan Lake (Ballet)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-11T23:23:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/15609ce4-72fd-54d5-84fe-1c187fd676d8', 'word_count': 1272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15609ce4-72fd-54d5-84fe-1c187fd676d8'}, {'abstract': 'The company presents “A Forest,” a new dance for nine, that is set to Haydn and includes costumes by a former company member, Maile Okamura.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/15/arts/dance/mark-morris-dance-group-offers-intimacy-in-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'The company presents “A Forest,” a new dance for nine, that is set to Haydn and includes costumes by a former company member, Maile Okamura.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Certain dances — especially those packed with details — warrant intimacy. The Mark Morris Dance Group grants that wish with a spring season at its Brooklyn quarters, with new and vintage works by the stellar Mr. Morris and, as always, live music. Along with the return of “Foursome” (2002), a suite of dances for four men featuring music by Erik Satie and Johann Nepomuk Hummel, and “Cargo” (2005), set to Darius Milhaud’s “La Création du Monde,” Op. 58, the company presents the premiere of “A Forest.” The new dance, for nine, is set to Haydn and includes costumes by the former company member Maile Okamura. Mr. Morris wraps things up with “The,” first shown last summer at Tanglewood Music Center. In that work, to Bach, same-sex couples run with clasped hands; there are raised fists. Does “The” have to do with marriage equality? One thing is sure: The close quarters will make Mr. Morris’s details shine. (Tuesday, May 17, through Sunday in Fort Greene, Brooklyn; 929-399-6634, mmdg.org/dancecentershows.)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 561, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1122, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/arts/15GUIDE4/15GUIDE4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mark Morris Dance Group Offers Intimacy in Brooklyn', 'kicker': 'The Week Ahead', 'co