et of construction work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Concerts by the ensemble Yarn/Wire typically come with a ton of baggage. The group is made up of two pianists, Laura Barger and Ning Yu, and two percussionists, Ian Antonio and Russell Greenberg, and when they perform, the stage is normally cluttered with instruments.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Yarn/Wire Plucks and Strikes, Rubs and Strums', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Plucking and Striking, Rubbing and Strumming', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'da Fonseca-Wollheim, Corinna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Michael (1956- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Material (Musical Work)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Findlay, Jim', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miller Theater at Columbia University', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yarn/Wire (Music Group)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-12T21:38:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corinna da Fonseca-Wollheim', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/17bb580e-750f-5d4f-a509-061e87a13ee7', 'word_count': 408, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17bb580e-750f-5d4f-a509-061e87a13ee7'}, {'abstract': 'This biopic follows the ascent of the Brazilian soccer player who became the sport’s greatest ambassador.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/13/movies/pele-birth-of-a-legend-review.html', 'snippet': 'This biopic follows the ascent of the Brazilian soccer player who became the sport’s greatest ambassador.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Jeff and Michael Zimbalist’s footballer biopic, “Pelé: Birth of a Legend,” we are endlessly told of the importance of what is known in Portuguese as “ginga”: a distinctly Brazilian swing and style of play. Ginga notwithstanding, this celebration of a soccer superstar’s rise from poverty to national treasure is more a familiar tale for fans to nod along with than a sports drama with a real kick.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PELE/13PELE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PELE/13PELE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PELE/13PELE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PELE/13PELE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PELE/13PELE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PELE/13PELE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/13/arts/13PE