nippet': 'The conservatory, in Philadelphia, received the gift from Nina Baroness von Maltzahn, one of the largest ever made to an American music school.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Curtis Institute of Music, the prestigious conservatory in Philadelphia, announced on Thursday that it has been given a $55 million gift from the outgoing chairwoman of its board, Nina Baroness von Maltzahn. It is one of the largest gifts ever made to an American music school, and a statement from the conservatory described the gift as the largest single donation it had received since Mary Louise Curtis Bok established its tuition-free policy in 1928.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Curtis Institute Gets $55 Million Gift', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Curtis Institute of Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-12T23:06:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5f95fe5f-c1d3-5ab6-afbf-aef686a76e8c', 'word_count': 240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5f95fe5f-c1d3-5ab6-afbf-aef686a76e8c'}, {'abstract': 'Investigators are still trying to solve the $81 million cyberheist from the central bank of Bangladesh in February.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/13/business/dealbook/swift-global-bank-network-attack.html', 'snippet': 'Investigators are still trying to solve the $81 million cyberheist from the central bank of Bangladesh in February.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thieves have again found their way into 