t Gridlock This Summer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'T.S.A. Offers New Measures to Ease Airport Gridlock This Summer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Ron', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeland Security Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Jeh C', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Delays (Transportation)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-13T22:21:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18eeff7f-d5da-56bc-a6c0-ce43eeb05a69', 'word_count': 703, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18eeff7f-d5da-56bc-a6c0-ce43eeb05a69'}, {'abstract': 'The concept of radical chic has been evolving for a couple of years and is now heading into formal evening wear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/15/fashion/bill-cunningham-rips-and-tears.html', 'snippet': 'The concept of radical chic has been evolving for a couple of years and is now heading into formal evening wear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The concept of radical chic has been evolving for a couple of years and is now heading into formal evening wear. Guests at black-tie affairs have appeared wearing their deconstructed jeans — most glaringly at the Met Gala, planned by Anna Wintour, who suggests that men wear white tie. One guest wore a bejeweled jacket and his knees exposed in torn jeans. Is this where evening wear is headed? Long skirts are also being slashed. The label Hood by Air is showing skirts and pants cut at the knee, the bottom half suspended by ribbons. Is this a reflection of the tearing apart of established political parties?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/fashion/15BILLCPROMO-ALT/15BILLCPROMO-ALT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Rips and Te