and insist it is the way to make beer, even though it is flexible when Germans want it to be.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/15/world/europe/beer-purity-law-a-german-tradition-and-marketing-tool-turns-500.html', 'snippet': 'Germans still revere their 500-year-old beer purity law, and insist it is the way to make beer, even though it is flexible when Germans want it to be.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INGOLSTADT, Germany — A pair of Bavarian dukes came to this pretty town on the Danube River 500 years ago and laid down what Germans claim as their source of beer-brewing prowess: the purity law.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beer Purity Law, a German Tradition (and Marketing Tool), Turns 500', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'German Beer Purity Law (and Marketing Tool) Turns 500', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ingolstadt (Germany)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-14T17:16:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alison Smale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9cdcc25b-4629-5085-a6d5-0f18766db6d2', 'word_count': 1150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9cdcc25b-4629-5085-a6d5-0f18766db6d2'}, {'abstract': 'As new companies grow, they are relying on a tool used by big corporations to shield themselves from potentially expensive class-action court cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/