yt://video/677dd483-7233-5668-821a-ef0b8af1af94', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/677dd483-7233-5668-821a-ef0b8af1af94'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers are again looking at hallucinogens, which were demonized in the wake of the 1960s, as a way to help with illnesses of the mind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/16/us/lsd-like-drugs-are-out-of-the-haze-and-back-in-the-labs.html', 'snippet': 'Researchers are again looking at hallucinogens, which were demonized in the wake of the 1960s, as a way to help with illnesses of the mind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At respected research centers in the United States and other countries, scientists have spent much of their professional lives in drug rehabilitation. It is not because they themselves struggle with addiction. What they are trying to rehabilitate are the drugs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/us/LSD/LSD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/11/us/LSD/LSD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/us/LSD/LSD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/us/LSD/LSD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/11/us/LSD/LSD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/11/us/LSD/LSD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe