f up to 40 percent. But some hospitals — and the companies that negotiate prices for them — said they were still waiting for details.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1340, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/business/17valeant/17valeant-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals Expands Drug Discount Offer After Criticism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Valeant Expands Drug Discount Offer After Criticism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals International Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thomas, Katie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-16T15:04:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Thomas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6441b693-b82c-53c2-abd6-7daf02e3c13e', 'word_count': 835, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6441b693-b82c-53c2-abd6-7daf02e3c13e'}, {'abstract': 'Goat’s and cow’s milk from Wisconsin and aging in Illinois produce a winner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/18/dining/wisconsin-cheese-chandoka.html', 'snippet': 'Goat’s and cow’s milk from Wisconsin and aging in Illinois produce a winner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aging does wonders for Chandoka, a prizewinning Cheddar-style cheese made with a mixture of cow’s and goat’s milk by LaClare Farms in Malone, Wis. Its rind takes on a mottled, almost silvery patina as the flavor of the pale cheese becomes more buttery, exhibiting hints of tangy horseradish in the aftertaste. The texture is firm and silkier than is typical for a Cheddar-style cheese. It is aged in the new cheese cave of Standard Market outside Chicago: $25.99 a pound, standardmarket.com/shop/westmont.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 502, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 502}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 856, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1713, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web/15BURNER-CHEDDAR_web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Distinctive Aged Cheddar-Style Cheese', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Slice: Made in Wisconsin, Aged in Illinois', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheese', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LaClare Farms (Malone, Wis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-16T15:05:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier':