ed in olive oil and sold at his new cafe at Falchi and his other locations. On the sweet side, his newest is a riff on a black-and-white cookie, not only iced with dark and white chocolate but also made so the cake doughnut underneath is half and half as well: Doughnut Plant, Falchi Building, 31-00 47th Avenue (31st Street), Long Island City, Queens, 212-505-3700 extension 310, doughnutplant.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web/15BURNER-DOUGHNUTS_web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/15/dining/15BUR