writer who has enjoyed loads of acclaim without the commensurate popularity. He has won a shocking array of awards for a guy whose name you may not know. His first book, “A Cold Day in Paradise” (1998), introduced the brawny Alex McKnight series and won both Edgar and Shamus awards, which amounts to big news in Mr. Hamilton’s line of work. The McKnight books have been popular enough, but they never made Alex a household name.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/arts/17BOOKHAMILTON2/17BOOKHAMILTON-1463420756898-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 937, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/17/arts/17BOOKHAMILTON2/17BOOKHAMILTON-1463420756898-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 937}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/arts/17BOOKHAMILTON2/17BOOKHAMILTON-1463420756898-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 657, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/arts/17BOOKHAMILTON2/17BOOKHAMILTON-1463420756898-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1411, 'width': 904, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/arts/17BOOKHAMILTON2/17BOOKHAMILTON-1463420756898-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/17/arts/17BOOKHAMILTON2/17BOOKHAMILTON-1463420756898-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/a