So why are we keeping it around?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/17/opinion/errol-morris-demon-in-the-freezer.html', 'snippet': 'Smallpox has inflicted untold suffering and death. So why are we keeping it around?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Smallpox was always present, filling the churchyard with corpses, tormenting with constant fear all whom it had not yet stricken, leaving on those whose lives it spared the hideous traces of its power, turning the babe into a changeling at which the mother shuddered, and making the eyes and cheeks of the betrothed maiden objects of horror to the lover. (1848)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Errol Morris: ‘Demon in the Freezer’', 'kicker': 'Op-Docs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smallpox', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Viruses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-17T11:05:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Errol Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Errol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/f05039aa-2242-574d-b5d3-026c337fdeb4', 'word_count': 431, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f05039aa-2242-574d-b5d3-026c337fdeb4'}, {'abstract': 'A new 80,000-seat stadium is rising in Inglewood, Calif., ready to welcome the Rams football team back from St. Louis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/05/17/business/inglewood-pins-hopes-for-commercial-revival-on-rams.html', 'snippet': 'A new 80,000-seat stadium is rising in Inglewood, Calif., 