m sunk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/18/sports/basketball/oklahoma-city-thunder-golden-state-warriors-game-1.html', 'snippet': 'Golden State lost Game 1 at home on Monday, with Oklahoma City’s Russell Westbrook not called for traveling late in the game. But the Warriors are far from sunk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At halftime, it seemed safe to go to bed. The Golden State Warriors led the Oklahoma City Thunder, 60-47, on Monday night. Golden State, the record-breaking 73-9 team, seemed to be cruising at home to a 1-0 series lead in the best-of-seven Western Conference finals. The half was capped by the N.B.A.’s most valuable player, Stephen Curry, swishing one of his trademark long 3-pointers over Andre Roberson.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18THUNDERweb1/18THUNDERweb1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18THUNDERweb1/18THUNDERweb1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18THUNDERweb1/18THUNDERweb1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18THUNDERweb1/18THUNDERweb1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1470, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18THUNDERweb1/18THUNDERweb1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'im