: 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/70ba5b4d-233d-5706-ae63-c9280db7b205', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70ba5b4d-233d-5706-ae63-c9280db7b205'}, {'abstract': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The Department of Justice launches a round-up of illegal aliens in 1941.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/05/17/1941-search-for-illegal-immigrants/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The Department of Justice launches a round-up of illegal aliens in 1941.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Department of Justice in Washington, moving with great secrecy and speed, launched last night a nation-wide round up of aliens who are in this country illegally. The enormous dragnet was concentrated in the cities along the Atlantic and Pacific seaboards, with New York a focal point in the East. Here squads totaling at least 500 city detectives, United States immigration officers and border patrol-men swept through sections of Manhattan, Brooklyn, the Bronx, Queens and Staten Island in the first city-wide round up of aliens since the government first began to crack down on potentially dangerous alien activities last month.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, May 18, 1941', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/blogs/18iht-oldmay18-japanese/18iht-oldmay18-japanese-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/18/blogs/18iht-oldmay18-japanese/18iht-oldmay18-japanese-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/blogs/18iht-oldmay18-japanese/18iht-oldmay18-japanese-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJum