article/6b201e78-8d73-57af-b62a-135b13fb0d2a'}, {'abstract': 'Nighttime treatments are popping up from the beaches of Turks and Caicos to the Tetons in Jackson Hole.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/17/t-magazine/spa-trend-moon-energy-turks-caicos-jackson-hole-sedona.html', 'snippet': 'Nighttime treatments are popping up from the beaches of Turks and Caicos to the Tetons in Jackson Hole.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I realized there’s nothing more enchanting than seeing the full moon dance off the water here,” says Karen Witt, the spa manager at the British colonial-style hotel the Palms. So she designed a playful and therapeutic riff on sunbathing: At night, under the full moon, guests receive foot and shoulder massages while lounging on beach chairs, to the soothing sounds of the nearby ocean.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/t-magazine/17tmag-lunar01/17tmag-lunar01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/17/t-magazine/17tmag-lunar01/17tmag-lunar01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/t-magazine/17tmag-lunar01/17tmag-lunar01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/t-magazine/17tmag-lunar01/17tmag-lunar01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/17/t-magazine/17tmag-lunar01/17tmag-lunar01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_