bd', 'word_count': 1265, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45191c95-935c-59b0-8cd0-02dd418415bd'}, {'abstract': 'This actress, known for “Finding Neverland” and “Mary Poppins,” performed pop and show tunes and occasional bold choices at Feinstein’s/54 Below.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/18/arts/music/review-laura-michelle-kelly-brings-her-broadway-voice-to-cabaret.html', 'snippet': 'This actress, known for “Finding Neverland” and “Mary Poppins,” performed pop and show tunes and occasional bold choices at Feinstein’s/54 Below.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An appropriate name for Laura Michelle Kelly’s untitled show at Feinstein’s/54 Below on Monday evening might have been “Finding My Way.” This British-born star of the Broadway musicals “Finding Neverland” and “Mary Poppins” has a bright, forceful theatrical soprano, but like many of her fellow Britons, she doesn’t distinguish between nightclub and theatrical singing, which are two very distinct genres.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/arts/18KELLY1/18KELLY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/18/arts/18KELLY1/18KELLY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/arts/18KELLY1/18KELLY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/arts/18KELLY1/18KELLY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/1