, 'word_count': 777, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06ef01e3-a102-542d-8270-17c59b5af310'}, {'abstract': 'David Wright and Lucas Duda are among the Mets being rested, whether they like it or not. But Steven Matz was scheduled to throw a side session Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/18/sports/baseball/david-wright-lucas-duda-ny-mets-injuries-matz.html', 'snippet': 'David Wright and Lucas Duda are among the Mets being rested, whether they like it or not. But Steven Matz was scheduled to throw a side session Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mets third baseman David Wright walked onto the grass at Citi Field shortly after 4 p.m. on Tuesday, smiling, ready to take batting practice. Moments later, he was upset after being told by Manager Terry Collins that he was being scratched from the lineup, joining first baseman Lucas Duda on the bench for the opener of a three-game series against the first-place Washington Nationals.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18-Y-METS/18-Y-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18-Y-METS/18-Y-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18-Y-METS/18-Y-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/sports/18-Y-METS/18-Y-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1473, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/