'abstract': 'The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau reported that borrowers often end up taking out multiple loans and remain in debt for months.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/19/your-money/single-payment-car-title-loans-can-lead-to-long-term-debt.html', 'snippet': 'The Consumer Financial Protection Bureau reported that borrowers often end up taking out multiple loans and remain in debt for months.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most borrowers who take out a single-payment car title loan end up borrowing again because they can’t afford to make the payment when it’s due, new federal research shows.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Single-Payment Car Title Loans Can Lead to Long-Term Debt', 'kicker': 'Your Money Adviser', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit and Debt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Financial Protection Bureau', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cordray, Richard', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Payday Loans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-18T20:38:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ffed62a-f75c-51f6-a24f-2a42983008b4', 'word_count': 684, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ffed62a-f75c-51f6-a24f-2a42983008b4'}, {'abstract': '“Authority Figure,” which centers on themes of power and submission, begins with a personality quiz to determine each participant’s individual experience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/18/t-magazine/art/authority-figure-performance-art-knockdown-center.html', 'snippet': '“Authority Figure,” which centers on themes of power and submission, begins with a personality quiz to determine each participant’s individual experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This weekend, an army of choreographers, performers and artists will take over the alternative arts space Knockdown Center to explore themes of obedience and submission — and are inviting audience members to join in. Directed by Sarah Kinlaw and Monica Mirabile, “Authority Figure” leverages movement, sound and sculpture to explore different modes of obedience and how they affect us.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-Authority-01/18tmag-Authority-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-Authority-01/18tmag-Authority-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-Authority-01/18tmag-Authority-01-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-Authority-01/18tmag-Authority-01-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-Authority-01/18tmag-Authority-01-thumbStandard-v3.jpg',