 for the red carpet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/18/t-magazine/entertainment/cannes-film-festival-julia-roberts-jessica-chastain.html', 'snippet': 'The stylist Elizabeth Stewart gives T a look inside her whirlwind week preparing both stars for the red carpet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, the stylist Elizabeth Stewart found herself running down the Croisette, the long promenade in Cannes, between Julia Roberts’s hotel room and Jessica Chastain’s. As the stylist to both stars during the Cannes Film Festival, which ends May 22, Stewart says she prepared outfits for several events — not to mention countless backup dresses and options for last-minute appearances that get on her clients’ schedules. “It’s all about being ready for any scenario,” she says.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ/18tmag-stylistdiary-slide-VQGQ-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/18/t-magazine/18tmag-styli