me each.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/19/sports/basketball/golden-state-warriors-even-series-with-okc-thunder-behind-stephen-curry-28-points.html', 'snippet': 'Curry scored 15 of his points in less than two minutes of the third quarter as Golden State sent the Western Conference finals back to Oklahoma City tied at one game each.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OAKLAND, Calif. — On one play, Stephen Curry dribbled 14 times, toying with defenders before bursting forward for a layup. On another, he dived over the first row of fans after a loose ball and disappeared like a magician. And during one breathtaking stretch of the third quarter, he did what he does best — score points in rapid succession — to turn a tight game into a blowout.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/sports/19WARRIORS/19WARRIORS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/19/sports/19WARRIORS/19WARRIORS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/sports/19WARRIORS/19WARRIORS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/sports/19WARRIORS/19WARRIORS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/sports/19WARRIORS/19WARRIORS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/19/sports/19WARRI