nal': 'By Nida Najar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Najar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd11ac45-5802-5606-bf2f-e612103dda8e', 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd11ac45-5802-5606-bf2f-e612103dda8e'}, {'abstract': 'NATO made a formal invitation on Thursday to tiny Montenegro to join the alliance as its 29th member, a move Russia strongly objects to.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/20/world/europe/nato-montenegro.html', 'snippet': 'NATO made a formal invitation on Thursday to tiny Montenegro to join the alliance as its 29th member, a move Russia strongly objects to.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — NATO made a formal invitation on Thursday to tiny Montenegro to join the alliance as its 29th member. NATO foreign ministers meeting in Brussels signed the accession protocol under the eyes of the Montenegrin prime minister, Milo Djukanovic. The membership must be approved by all 28 national governments or parliaments, including the United States Senate.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NATO Invites Montenegro to Join Alliance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Montenegro Is Invited to Join NATO', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'North Atlantic Treaty Organization', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Montenegro', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-19T17:57:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None,