: 'A weeklong festival features 17 companies, four film presentations and four world premieres.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/22/arts/dance/italian-dance-tradition-and-immigration.html', 'snippet': 'A weeklong festival features 17 companies, four film presentations and four world premieres.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Italians have arrived, and they’ll just keep dancing. For most of this week they’ll be seen onstage, onscreen and even offering improvised events before shows and during intermissions. All this is part of the second annual festival presented by Idaco nyc (the Italian Dance Connection), an organization that seeks to unite dancers from Italy with Italian dancers working independently in New York or as members of New York companies.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1431, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/arts/22GUIDE5/22GUIDE5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Italian Dance: Tradition and Immigration', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Italian Movement in All Shapes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Italian Cultural Institute', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sheen Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Italian Dance Connection', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-19T18:20:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Anderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a976ca08-e598-59c5-935b-77bc8d748fcd', 'word_count': 141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a976ca08-e598-59c5-935b-77bc8d748fcd'}, {'abstract': 'The story of two strong women who have fought against society’s constraints.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/22/opinion/campaign-stops/what-my-mother-sees-in-hillary.html', 'snippet': 'The story of two strong women who have fought against society’s constraints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN 1973, my mother’s first husband was killed in a car crash in downtown St. Louis. My brother, Jason, was nine months old. In swift succession, my mother lost the following things: the father of her first child; access to a credit card; her car insurance; and the ability to take out a loan. The first was terrible luck. The other things were taken from her because she was a single woman — with a son, to boot — it was the 1970s, and, as she put it, “you were not considered legitimate at that time unless you had a man in your life.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 562, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1050, 'width': 1912, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/22/opinion/sunday/22gutting/22gutting-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What My Mother Sees in Hillary', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headli