act extends beyond the realm of music — thanks largely to Combs’s former girlfriend, the fashion stylist and costume designer Misa Hylton. Starting from their basement in Scarsdale, Hylton created a spectrum of iconic looks for the likes of Missy Elliott, Mary J. Blige and Combs himself that continue to remain points of reference for today’s performers.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1524, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R/MIsa-Hylton-slide-Q87R-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/t-magazine/MIsa-Hylton-sl