in-the-flesh.html', 'snippet': 'The program, at the Baryshnikov Arts Center, looks at the choreographer’s early works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The title of the Baryshnikov Arts Center’s Wednesday and Thursday program is, accurately, “Merce Cunningham Early Works.” But the hourlong event was more: a piece of New York cultural history — a time machine to the city’s radically modernist arts world of the 1950s, when Cunningham was at the epicenter of the New York Schools of painting and music, and when it would have been fair to speak of a New York School of dance.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20CUNNINGHAM1/20CUNNINGHAM1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Merce Cunningham’s Work, on Film, Then in the Flesh', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'See It Onscreen and Then Onstage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce, Trust', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baryshnikov Arts Center', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Riener, Silas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-19T21:39:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alastair Macaulay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alastair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macaulay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3314e82-18b8-551c-a070-a2dc2773ab15', 'word_count': 697, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3314e82-18b8-551c-a070-a2dc2773ab15'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Fellowes adds charm and humor to each of the four episodes of his mini-series, which will become available for streaming Friday on Amazon Prime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/20/arts/television/review-julian-fellowes-hosts-doctor-thorne-a-british-period-drama-on-amazon.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Fellowes adds charm and humor to each of the four episodes of his mini-series, which will become available for streaming Friday on Amazon Prime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For six seasons, Julian Fellowes’s “Downton Abbey” was shown in the United States as part of PBS’s “Masterpiece,” which meant that its episodes were introduced by the American actress Laura Linney. Mr. Fellowes’s new examination of British pride and impropriety, “Julian Fellowes Presents Doctor Thorne,” will stream on Amazon Prime (the four episodes are available Friday), where it has a host who’s more in the classic vein: Mr. Fellowes, doing his best Alistair Cooke impression.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/20/arts/20THORNE1/20THORNE1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Julian Fellowes Hosts ‘Doctor Thorne,’ a British Period Dr