8c1d9-4948-51b9-8ebd-bc369c3019a1'}, {'abstract': 'Islamic State was said to have claimed responsibility for the killing of Sanaur Rahman, which followed a string of similar attacks that have accelerated in recent weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/21/world/asia/bangladesh-doctor-machete.html', 'snippet': 'Islamic State was said to have claimed responsibility for the killing of Sanaur Rahman, which followed a string of similar attacks that have accelerated in recent weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DHAKA, Bangladesh — A doctor in western Bangladesh was killed by machete-wielding assailants as he rode to his clinic on Friday morning, the police said, the most recent in a string of such attacks in the country.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Doctor Killed in Bangladeshi Machete Attack', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bangladesh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-20T13:43:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julfikar Ali Manik and Nida Najar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julfikar', 'middlename': 'Ali', 'lastname': 'Manik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nida', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Najar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e4dbba5-7bd8-540b-9c49-9dbee5b79a6c', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e4dbba5-7bd8-540b-9c49-9dbee5b79a6c'}, {'abstract': "This video includes violent scenes and graphic language. It has been condensed from its original length but is otherwise unaltered. On Nov. 20, 2015, Chase Sherman was handcuffed and stunned with a Taser by two Coweta County, Ga., sheriff's deputies responding to a 911 call from his parents. He died at the scene. The body cameras worn by the deputies captured the episode.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000004423646/body-cameras-show-man-fatally-tasered-while-handcuffed.html', 'snippet': "This video includes violent scenes and graphic language. It has been condensed from its original length but is otherwise unaltered. On Nov. 20, 2015, Chase Sherman was handcuffed and stunned with a Taser by two Coweta County, Ga., sheriff's deputi...", 'lead_paragraph': "This video includes violent scenes and graphic language. It has been condensed from its original length but is otherwise unaltered. On Nov. 20, 2015, Chase Sherman was handcuffed and stunned with a Taser by two Coweta County, Ga., sheriff's deputies responding to a 911 call from his parents. He died at the scene. The body cameras worn by the deputies captured the episode.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/multimedia/20georgia-bodycam-taser/20georgia-bodycam-taser-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/19/multimedia/20georgia-bodycam-taser/20georgia-bodycam-taser-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/multimedia/20georgia-bodycam-taser/20georgia-bodycam-taser-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/19/multimedia/20georgia-bodycam-taser/20georg