 None, 'print_headline': 'Digital Trail Is Retraced After Killing  of Girl, 13', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spencer, Hawes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keepers, Natalie M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eisenhauer, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lovell, Nicole Madison', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-21T01:29:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hawes Spencer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hawes', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spencer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80527b98-6b9d-5148-b281-54adfd80ea48', 'word_count': 718, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80527b98-6b9d-5148-b281-54adfd80ea48'}, {'abstract': 'Investigators are trying to locate Anthony Lopez, 31, last seen wheeling a woman’s body in the Mariners Harbor neighborhood on the island’s northern shore.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/21/nyregion/police-search-for-man-spotted-pushing-dead-woman-on-dolly-on-staten-island.html', 'snippet': 'Investigators are trying to locate Anthony Lopez, 31, last seen wheeling a woman’s body in the Mariners Harbor neighborhood on the island’s northern shore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a narrow street on Staten Island lined with mostly brick-and-siding duplexes, it was a conspicuous sight: A man pushing the body of an unconscious woman on a dolly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Police Search for Man Spotted Pushing Dead Woman on Dolly on Staten Island', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Police Seek Man Seen Pushing Body', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Staten Island (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rojas, Rick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Anthony N (1985- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-21T01:36:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Rojas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rojas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee2093a4-70da-567b-87b8-9836aa9b9865', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee2093a4-70da-567b-87b8-9836aa9b9865'}, {'abstract': 'Mexico and the United States have a lot to gain from a binational, legal marijuana market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/21/opinion/legalized-pot-free-trade.html', 'snippet': 'Mexico and the United States have a lot to gain from a binational, legal marijuana market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mexico City — WHEN the Mexican Army actually allows journalists to watch its soldiers in action, it’s often to see them burning marijuana crops. It’s strictly for show, but it’s fun. You get to fly in a military helicopter over the Sierra Madre, then touch down to see troops posing with their rifles as they walk into green marijuana fields. And the highlight: You watch hundreds of pounds of grass go up in flames.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1400, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/21/opinion/21grillo/21grillo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Legalized Pot, Free Trade', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Legal Pot, Free Trade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grillo, Ioan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pena Nieto, Enrique', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-21T01:55:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_d