64-ad6f-7c7a882f28aa'}, {'abstract': 'As the local matchup tries to gain footing and luster it has barely been much of a rivalry at all, with the Red Bulls winning all four games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/22/sports/soccer/red-bulls-demolish-new-york-city-in-what-has-been-a-one-sided-rivalry.html', 'snippet': 'As the local matchup tries to gain footing and luster it has barely been much of a rivalry at all, with the Red Bulls winning all four games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Frank Lampard, the decorated English star, jogged onto the field at Yankee Stadium on Saturday afternoon, he found himself in unexpectedly antagonistic territory. After being sidelined for more than two months at the beginning of the season, he was finally making his debut for New York City F.C. in the 75th minute of their 13th game. His reception was unwelcoming: a chorus of boos from the crowd. It was hardly the worst indignity of the day for the home team.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Bulls Demolish New York City in What Has Been a One-Sided Rivalry', 'kicker': 'Red Bulls 7, N.Y.C.F.C. 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Red Bulls Demolish New York City F.C. in a Rivalry That Remains One-Sided', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Football Club (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Red Bulls (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-22T01:18:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Vorkunov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vorkunov', 'qualifier': None, 'title':