 Douaumont, described by the Crown Prince as “the key-stone of the Verdun defences,” returned to French hands in 1916.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/05/22/1916-douaumont-fort-retaken/', 'snippet': 'From the International Herald Tribune archives: The fort of Douaumont, described by the Crown Prince as “the key-stone of the Verdun defences,” returned to French hands in 1916.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Douaumont fort, lost three months ago at the outset of the German offensive, and described by the Crown Prince as “the key-stone of the Verdun defences,” is again in French hands.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1916: Douaumont Fort Retaken', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-22T10:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c02f936b-fc46-5a51-baf9-436863166fbf', 'word_count': 195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c02f936b-fc46-5a51-baf9-436863166fbf'}, {'abstract': 'The strike, which Afghan intelligence said had killed the leader, indicated a major break with precedent as the United States circumvented Pakistan, which has been unable to broker peace talks with the Taliban.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/23/world/asia/afghanistan-taliban-leader-mullah-mansour.html', 'snippet': 'The strike, which Afghan intelligence said had killed the leader, indicated a major break with precedent as the United States circumvented Pakistan, which has been unable to broker peace talks with the Taliban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — After months of failed Pakistani efforts to broker peace talks with the Taliban, an American drone strike against the leader of the Afghan militants signaled a major break with precedent as the United States circumvented Pakistan in an effort to disrupt the strengthening insurgency, officials said on Sunday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23AFGHANISTAN/23AFGHANISTAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23AFGHANISTAN/23AFGHANISTAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23AFGHANISTAN/23AFGHANISTAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23AFGHANISTAN/23AFGHANISTAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1230, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23AFGHANISTAN/23AFGHANISTAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23AFGHANISTAN/23AFGHANISTAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/wor