al': 'By Tom Rachman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rachman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbc731f7-8820-5e4a-a625-e62f25627b27', 'word_count': 1390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbc731f7-8820-5e4a-a625-e62f25627b27'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s private discussions at the Group of 7 summit in Japan are likely to cover a topic not on the agenda: Mr. Trump’s chances of becoming president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/23/world/asia/obama-donald-trump-japan.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s private discussions at the Group of 7 summit in Japan are likely to cover a topic not on the agenda: Mr. Trump’s chances of becoming president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HANOI, Vietnam — Officially, the top world leaders who gather Thursday at the Group of 7 summit meeting will talk about shared concerns, like global trade or the Islamic State. But their private discussions are likely to cover a topic that is not on the agenda: Donald J. Trump.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23WHLETTER/23WHLETTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23WHLETTER/23WHLETTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23WHLETTER/23WHLETTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/23/world/23WHLETTER/23WHLETTER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1295, 'width': 2048, 