nica Ruta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Domenica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc5f3109-35e6-5136-b203-a0451a0dd94d', 'word_count': 1146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc5f3109-35e6-5136-b203-a0451a0dd94d'}, {'abstract': 'Readers offered their suggestions for improving New York City’s transit system, in response to an editorial.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/05/24/how-would-you-fix-the-subway/', 'snippet': 'Readers offered their suggestions for improving New York City’s transit system, in response to an editorial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New Yorkers have very strong feelings about their subway, so it comes as no surprise that an editorial on how to fix the system published\xa0on Saturday\xa0got more than 600 comments. Many readers offered suggestions for improving the system and others questioned whether it could ever be fixed given the mendacity of New York politicians. In the spirit of keeping the conversation going, I offer responses to a sampling of the comments by our readers (some comments have been excerpted for brevity).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/opinion/24bajajWEB/24bajajWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/24/opinion/24bajajWEB/24bajajWEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/opinion/24bajajWEB/24bajajWEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/