Sodermalm neighborhood of Stockholm, is starkly minimal. With steel fixtures, unvarnished hardwood floors and whitewashed brick walls, the space allows Stutterheim’s rows of colorful raincoats to be the focus. “We have worked long and hard to create context and circumstances for our collection to look as good as it can,” says Johan Loman, the brand’s co-founder and director of marketing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/24/t-magazine/24tmag-stutterheim01/24tmag-stutterheim01-thumbLarg