 form, to the college in Queens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/26/nyregion/halal-guys-to-donate-30000-to-laguardia-community-college.html', 'snippet': 'The food cart that has gained global recognition will donate 6,000 sandwiches, in check form, to the college in Queens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Halal Guys food cart in front of LaGuardia Community College in Queens looks pretty much like any other cart on that stretch of Thomson Avenue, and its prices are low enough not to scare away the students: $5 for a falafel sandwich, $7 for gyro over rice and $5 for chicken wrapped in pita and doused in sauce.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/26/nyregion/26HALAL1/26HALAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/26/nyregion/26HALAL1/26HALAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/26/nyregion/26HALAL1/26HALAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/26/nyregion/26HALAL1/26HALAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/26/nyregion/26HALAL1/26HALAL1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/26/nyregion/26HALAL1/26HALAL1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': No