d Sharks teammates since 2005, are in the Stanley Cup finals for the first time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/27/sports/hockey/stanley-cup-finals-san-jose-sharks.html', 'snippet': 'Patrick Marleau and Joe Thornton, drafted in 1997 and Sharks teammates since 2005, are in the Stanley Cup finals for the first time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN JOSE, Calif. — Patrick Marleau and Joe Thornton sat side by side, waiting to field questions shortly after the San Jose Sharks had advanced to the Stanley Cup finals for the first time in their 25-year history with a 5-2 victory over the St. Louis Blues.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/sports/27sharks-web1/27sharks-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/27/sports/27sharks-web1/27sharks-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/sports/27sharks-web1/27sharks-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/sports/27sharks-web1/27sharks-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1257, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/sports/27sharks-web1/27sharks-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/27/sports/27sharks-web1/27sharks-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype'