es relevant to just about anywhere. In the near future, a particular race is singled out for oppression and relegated to a sector known as “the Zone.” In this case, that race is known as the Hairies, a descriptive name indeed.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 726, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1452, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE7/29GUIDE7-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Cleverman’ is Sci-Fi With a Social Conscience', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Television; Science Fiction, Social Conscience', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SundanceTV', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Cleverman (TV Program)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-26T20:41:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0de5b108-3914-5f67-b607-59ca3c7469de', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0de5b108-3914-5f67-b607-59ca3c7469de'}, {'abstract': 'Matt Wilson’s wife died two years ago, and a new album and a coming show at the Jazz Standard will serve as a kind of memorial to her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/29/arts/music/a-jazz-drummer-honoring-his-wife-with-help-from-friends.html', 'snippet': 'Matt Wilson’s wife died two years ago, and a new album and a coming show at the Jazz Standard will serve as a kind of memorial to her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, Matt Wilson, a leading jazz drummer, lost his wife, Felicia — a violinist and orchestra teacher, mother to their four children — to leukemia. Reeling with grief, he convened some of his closest collaborators for a series of spirited sessions in her honor. The result is “Beginning of a Memory,” an earnest and upbeat album just out on Palmetto. Credited to Matt Wilson’s Big Happy Family, it features past and present members of his three main bands: Arts & Crafts, his quartet and Christmas Tree-O. The repertory similarly honors a retrospective urge, with pieces from across his 20-year recording career: “Schoolboy Thug,” a punkish favorite of Felicia’s, follows a more recent staple, “Feel the Sway.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 868, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 868}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1417, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29GUIDE6/29GUIDE6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Jazz Drummer Honoring His Wife With Help From Friends', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pop; A Jazz Drummer Honors His Wife', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jazz Standard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Matt (1964- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Beginnin