a150402-f938-5982-86b7-02eccf53e43c'}, {'abstract': 'Emma Straub, daughter of the best-selling horror and suspense writer Peter Straub, discusses her new book, “Modern Lovers,” about two couples in crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/27/books/as-a-straub-she-was-born-to-be-an-author.html', 'snippet': 'Emma Straub, daughter of the best-selling horror and suspense writer Peter Straub, discusses her new book, “Modern Lovers,” about two couples in crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Growing up in the shadow of a famous novelist would probably deter most people from pursuing a career as a fiction writer. It had the opposite effect on Emma Straub, daughter of the best-selling horror and suspense writer Peter Straub.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27STRAUB/27STRAUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27STRAUB/27STRAUB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27STRAUB/27STRAUB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27STRAUB/27STRAUB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27STRAUB/27STRAUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27STRAUB/27STRAUB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75