im-on-combat-medals-is-disputed.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Kyle, decorated for killing enemy fighters as a member of the Navy SEALs, did not receive as many medals as his book claimed, the website The Intercept reported.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Kyle was decorated for killing scores of enemy fighters as a Navy sniper during four deployments in Iraq. His best-selling book, “American Sniper,” detailed his adventures as “the most lethal sniper in U.S. military history,” and the 2014 film of the same name became the top-grossing military movie of all time.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘American Sniper’ Claim on Combat Medals Is Disputed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Medals Count by Member of SEALs  Is Disputed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Philipps, Dave', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kyle, Chris (1974-2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Navy Seals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'American Sniper (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-26T21:50:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Philipps', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Philipps', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a760a99-f066-5ceb-b3ae-b2000b78289f', 'word_count': 560, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a760a99-f066-5ceb-b3ae-b2000b78289f'}, {'abstract': 'Hany Abu-Assad’s film expands on the story of Mohammed Assaf, a Palestinian pop singer who won “Arab Idol” in 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/27/movies/the-idol-review.html', 'snippet': 'Hany Abu-Assad’s film expands on the story of Mohammed Assaf, a Palestinian pop singer who won “Arab Idol” in 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hany Abu-Assad’s “The Idol” expands on the underdog story of Mohammed Assaf, an acclaimed Palestinian pop singer from the Gaza Strip. Mr. Assaf earned fame by winning “Arab Idol” in 2013 after trekking to auditions in Egypt. As portrayed in this admiring fictionalized feature, he just about has the power of traveling singers of myth, able to cross insurmountable barriers and sway hearts with his honeyed voice.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27IDOL/27IDOL-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27IDOL/27IDOL-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27IDOL/27IDOL-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27IDOL/27IDOL-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27IDOL/27IDOL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/27/arts/27IDOL/27IDOL-thumbStandard