d India’s Dashed Economic Hopes', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Modi’s economic disappointment', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-27T14:57:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aatish Taseer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aatish', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taseer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/826f3812-f9d6-5d1f-a18f-69dfd05d3a30', 'word_count': 937, 'uri': 'nyt://article/826f3812-f9d6-5d1f-a18f-69dfd05d3a30'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Clarke, known for playing the mother of dragons on ‘Thrones,’ stars in the film “Me Before You.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/29/movies/emilia-clarke-on-game-of-thrones-surfing-and-me-before-you.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Clarke, known for playing the mother of dragons on ‘Thrones,’ stars in the film “Me Before You.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Daenerys Targaryen in HBO’s “Game of Thrones,” the British actress Emilia Clarke battles evil while armed with dragons and an apparent immunity to fire. But as Louisa Clark in “Me Before You,” she’s a mere mortal caring for a demonically angry Englishman (Sam Claflin) determined to end his life after being hit by a motorcycle and paralyzed. At which point Lou decides to help him live again.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/0