o-fashion-mens.html', 'snippet': 'With the help of an unbuttoned Christophe Lemaire shirt, the 53-year-old actor has a moment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every now and then, a movie succeeds as much because of its style — the clothes, the cars, the hair — as its story. When a guy’s coolness leaps out from the screen, there is usually a sexy actor whose sense of style matches how dangerous his character is: Steve McQueen in his black turtleneck, holsters on display, in “Bullitt”; Ryan Gosling in a retro bomber jacket with a scorpion on the back in “Drive.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1030, 'width': 1596, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/03/fashion/03-FIENNES-1/03-FIENNES-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ralph Fiennes Makes a Fashion Splash', 'kicker': 'Screen Style', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ralph Fiennes Makes a Fashion Splash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernstein, Jacob', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fiennes, Ralph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guadagnino, Luca', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lemaire, Christophe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'A Bigger Splash (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-27T16:52:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Men’s Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jacob Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jacob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d603cf50-32ca-5273-a81a-e5af66ca34ef', 'word_count': 522, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d603cf50-32ca-5273-a81a-e5af66ca34ef'}, {'abstract': 'Deciding whether the convenience of a Slender Tunic trumps the desire to protest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/04/25/magazine/whats-a-swimsuit-worth.html', 'snippet': 'Deciding whether the convenience of a Slender Tunic trumps the desire to protest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Conscientious objection, one of the few forms of activism I have time for, is a fraught thing. I really do try to stay away from corporations that have been problematic for my politics. I don’t ever step foot in a Chick-fil-A restaurant because of the company’s hostility toward L.G.B.T. causes, though if I’m honest, I don’t really know where to find one in my neighborhood anyway. I would never patronize Hobby Lobby because I believe in women’s access to contraception, but I also can’t say that I have consumer needs that Hobby Lobby can fill, either.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 873, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 873}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 873, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 873, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/04/magazine/04mag-landsend/04mag-landsend-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s a Sw