ge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29SHORTRUDOLPH/29SHORTRUDOLPH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29SHORTRUDOLPH/29SHORTRUDOLPH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29SHORTRUDOLPH/29SHORTRUDOLPH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1410, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29SHORTRUDOLPH/29SHORTRUDOLPH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29SHORTRUDOLPH/29SHORTRUDOLPH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/29/arts/29SHORTRUDOLPH/29SHORTRUDOLPH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Martin Short and Maya Rudolph Schmooze About Their New Variety Show', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘There Could Be a Show Here’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rudolph, Maya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Short, Martin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Maya & Marty (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-27T20:31:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03233e67-884b-5e80-a57e-9677baaa5b3a', 'word_count': 1173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03233e67-884b-5e80-a57e-9677baaa5b3a'}, {'abstract': 'While there could be extra rewards in bundling Monsanto’s high-tech seeds with Bayer’s crop sprays, a merger might not produce enough profit to justify a higher offer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/28/business/dealbook/squaring-a-bid-for-monsanto-with-bayers-reward.html', 'snippet': 'While there could be extra rewards in bundling Monsanto’s high-tech seeds with Bayer’s crop sprays, a merger might not produce enough profit to justify a higher offer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The German chemical group Bayer’s bid for Monsanto may yield a poor financial harvest. Bayer’s rejected $62 billion offer for Monsanto, an American seed maker, already appears to violate one of its crucial management principles: sticking to projects whose returns beat their cost of capital. Raising the price from the current $122 a share to win over its intended partner would require heroic sales-growth assumptions to stack up.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/25/business/25db-monsanto/25db-monsanto-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/25/business/25db-monsanto/25db-monsanto-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/25/business/25db-monsanto/25db-monsanto-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy