fdc3eb'}, {'abstract': 'A dangerous form of drug resistance has reached the United States, leaving us just one step away from infections that are completely untreatable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/28/health/answers-antibiotic-resistance.html', 'snippet': 'A dangerous form of drug resistance has reached the United States, leaving us just one step away from infections that are completely untreatable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The idea of people dying from infections that were once easily cured may seem outlandish. But it is happening already — taking about 23,000 lives in the United States a year — and experts warn that things will get worse because bacteria are becoming resistant to antibiotics faster than we can make new drugs to fight back.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Short Answers to Hard Questions About Antibiotic Resistance', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bacteria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIBIOTICS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Livestock Diseases', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-05-28T01:03:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise, Erica Goode and Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goode', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None