y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How do you memorialize a priest like the Rev. John C. Flynn? From 1989 until he retired — reluctantly — in 2010, he led St. Martin of Tours Church, and became famous for taking his ministry into the Bronx neighborhood of Crotona. When he despaired over saying funeral Masses for teenagers felled by drugs and gang violence, he took to the streets, offering to exchange a crucifix for a gun. It was symbolic, he admitted. But so, he said, was the cross that was at the center of his faith.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1371, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/05/30/nyregion/30SIDE2/30SIDE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 