ion_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/985c377c-51db-5df4-a759-e9537d5bef70', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/985c377c-51db-5df4-a759-e9537d5bef70'}, {'abstract': 'Even if it called me a sexist and a terrible writer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/05/31/opinion/i-stand-with-gawker.html', 'snippet': 'Even if it called me a sexist and a terrible writer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I HAVE been attacked pretty much my entire career by Gawker. I made its list of “least important writers” twice, and it put me in 62nd place on its “worst 100 white men” list, which also included Judas Iscariot and Joe Paterno. Gawker writers have called me a “terrible writer” and a “terrible sexist” and insinuated that my wife wants to stab me.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/01/opinion/31marcheWeb/31marcheWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/06/01/opinion/31marcheWeb/31marcheWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/01/opinion/31marcheWeb/31marcheWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/01/opinion/31marcheWeb/31marcheWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1410, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/01/opinion/31marcheWeb/31marcheWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'sub